## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## VacaFlow
## Deliverable constraint (Intent.md TC-18): the source package must exclude
## node_modules, .next, bin and obj.
## Legal constraint (Intent.md LC-03): the SQLite database file must never be
## committed. It holds emails, password hashes, names, reasons and comments.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- SQLite database (LC-03) ---
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- .NET ---
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
.vs/
*.received.*

# --- Node / Next.js ---
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
.pnpm-store/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# --- Environment and secrets (TC-14) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.pfx
secrets.json

# --- Test and coverage output ---
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.trx

# --- Editors ---
.idea/
*.swp
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- OS ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Packaged deliverables (built, not versioned) ---
*.zip
